sequenceDiagram
    participant O as Human job owner
    participant G as Gate orchestrator
    participant S as Durable run store
    participant C1 as Codex attempt one
    participant P as Typed observer
    participant R as Evidence reviewer
    participant C2 as Codex attempt two

    O->>G: Supply authoritative brief
    G->>C1: Send first coding prompt
    C1-->>G: Return generated handler
    G->>P: Execute declared checks
    P-->>G: Return typed attempt evidence
    G->>S: Persist attempt and policy snapshot
    alt Evidence passes policy checks
        loop Each owner decision
            G->>R: Send brief and observed behavior
            R-->>G: Return evidence classification
        end
        G-->>O: Pause with decision requests
        O->>G: Record typed owner answers
        G->>C2: Send fresh prompt with completed intent
        C2-->>G: Return regenerated handler
        G->>P: Execute every declared check again
        P-->>G: Return full retry evidence
        G->>G: Evaluate policy and selected decisions
        G-->>O: Return COMPLETED FAILED or COVERAGE_GAP
    else Decision unknown or coverage missing
        G->>S: Mark run as COVERAGE_GAP
        Note over S: Available for later platform engineering review
        G-->>O: Stop without product decision or retry
    else Invariant violated or effect forbidden
        G->>S: Persist typed failure
        G-->>O: Return FAILED
    end
